      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "ableism_stereotype_2",
      "label": "Inspiration porn/pity narratives",
      "description": "The image and text together may unintentionally or intentionally normalize or trivialize the subjects' condition by presenting them in a context that reduces their identities to a simple, stereotypical greeting. This can contribute to ableist perceptions by implying that the subjects are not fully capable of engaging in normal social discourse, thereby reinforcing societal biases.",
